  },
  {
   "say": "The medical name is nocturnal emissions.",
   "cap": "THE MEDICAL NAME: | *NOCTURNAL* | *EMISSIONS.*",
   "pause": 0.45
  },
  {
   "say": "In puberty, testosterone goes up.",
   "cap": "IN PUBERTY, | *TESTOSTERONE* | GOES UP.",
   "pause": 0.2
  },
  {
   "say": "And the testicles start making millions of sperm every day.",
   "cap": "AND THE TESTICLES | START MAKING | *MILLIONS* OF SPERM | EVERY DAY.",
   "pause": 0.45
