   "cap": "YOU *CAN'T CONTROL IT,* | AND YOU | *CAN'T STOP IT.*",
   "pause": 0.45
  },
  {
   "say": "It often starts around twelve or thirteen.",
   "cap": "IT OFTEN STARTS | AROUND *12 OR 13.*",
   "pause": 0.2
  },
  {
   "say": "And it gets less common as you get older.",
   "cap": "AND IT GETS | *LESS COMMON* | AS YOU GET OLDER.",
   "pause": 0.45
  },
  {
   "say": "Some guys never have one. Also normal.",
   "cap": "SOME GUYS | *NEVER* HAVE ONE. | ALSO *NORMAL.*",
   "pause": 0.2
  },
  {
   "say": "And yes, girls can have them too.",
